## Governance

Self-allocated via `POST /api/v1/vtid/allocate` (VTID-03791). A second,
accidental allocate call produced VTID-03792 with no work ever attached to
it; terminalized it `cancelled` via direct Supabase update (gateway has no
PATCH /api/v1/vtid/:id route to correct a duplicate allocation) rather than
leaving a dangling "Allocated - Pending Title" row. VTID-03791 itself was
set to `status='in_progress'`, `spec_status='approved'` the same way, per
CLAUDE.md §4.1 — the user's own "Yes, flip it on staging" instruction is
the approval.
